/-!
# The Jacobian conjecture implies the Poisson conjecture

A formal proof of Formal Conjectures' `poisson_conjecture.variants.jacobian_implication`: the
Jacobian conjecture in dimension `2n` implies the Poisson conjecture in dimension `n`, following
K. Adjamagbo and A. van den Essen, *A proof of the equivalence of the Dixmier, Jacobian and
Poisson conjectures*, Acta Math. Vietnam. 32 (2007), 205–214 (arXiv:math/0608009), Theorem 1 and
Theorem 7.
-/
